id=belleui_sysui
name=BelleUI - System UI (experimental)
version=v0.1
versionCode=1
author=BelleUI
description=EXPERIMENTAL. Replaces Android's SystemUI with the Belle status bar, Status menu (pull-down), volume pop-up and power menu. No lock screen. Android 11, ROMs signed with the AOSP test keys only. Disables itself after 3 boots that do not come up.
